<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In 𝖠𝗊𝗎𝖺𝖵𝖫𝖬: Improving Underwater Situation Awareness with Mobile Vision Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>Related Work</span></a></li>
